My favorite method for making unholy water without loosing protection :

Name 10 or so potions of uncursed water with individual names (water 1, 
water2, water 3 etc...). You'll have to drop and pick them several times 
in the process while naming them, so they don't stack.

Drop everything else except the named potions of water. Read a confused 
blessed scroll of remove curse. 25% of the uncursed items in your 
inventory will be blessed, 25% will be cursed.

This way you will certainly have at least 1 potion of unholy water 
without angering your god at all. No protection loss.

Sure it burns a scroll of remove curse. But I think it certainly worth 
it. Maybe other readers will have better way to make unholy water... but 
it is the best I found.

